# Return to Delkfutt's Tower: a helper, area 2. Main (current; the login's zone-in 0 sets status 1) and eve
# (the mission completed, Ro'Maeve current) both get the menu (bit 1) and enter area 2 (option 2). Area 2's
# Kamlanaut (+1) dies: 32001 to both (eve's with a seventh param, 1). Eve's finish gives the Destroyer of
# Antiquity title; main's gives it too and, as Return to Delkfutt's Tower's
# (mission.zilart.return_to_delkfutts_tower), sets status 2.
lists StellarFulcrum/_4z0/onTrigger StellarFulcrum/onEventUpdate/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32000 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32001 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/32002 StellarFulcrum/onZoneIn/1 StellarFulcrum/onEventFinish/17 StellarFulcrum/_4z1/onTrigger
char zone=StellarFulcrum pos=-520,-4,17 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char eve zone=StellarFulcrum pos=-520,-4,17 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart ReturnToDelkfuttsTower current
eve: mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
eve: mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
eve: mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
eve: mission Soa Abomination current
eve: mission Zilart ReturnToDelkfuttsTower completed
eve: mission Zilart Romaeve current
login                                   # the mission's zone-in 0 at status 0, answered: status 1
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _4z0
update 32000 option=2                   # index 0, area 2: entered
finish
eve: trigger _4z0
eve: update 32000 option=2
eve: finish
tick 2000
kill KAMLANAUT+1                        # dead: won, 32001 to both
eve: finish                             # eve (not current): the title
finish                                  # main: the title; the mission's: status 2
